3年には「ファントム・リバティ」という追加のゲームが出ました。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["美国派拉蒙影业宣布要拍这部电影。曾制作《变形金刚》电影的制片人和开发这款游戏的公司将一起合作。", "这款游戏2020年发售。刚上市时问题很多，但到现在全球已经卖出超过4000万份。基努·里维斯在游戏里出演。", "2023年推出了资料片《往日之影》，也卖出了1500多万份。动画《边缘行者》也很受欢迎，第二季本月将在网飞上线。"], "body": "アメリカのパラマウント・ピクチャーズが、映画を作ると発表しました。トランスフォーマーの映画で有名なプロデューサーと、ゲームを作った会社が一緒に働きます。\n\nゲームは2020年に出ました。最初は問題が多かったですが、今までに世界で4000万本以上売れました。キアヌ・リーブスが出ています。\n\n2023年には「ファントム・リバティ」という追加のゲームが出ました。", "body_zh": "美国派拉蒙影业宣布要拍这部电影。曾制作《变形金刚》电影的制片人和开发这款游戏的公司将一起合作。\n\n这款游戏2020年发售。刚上市时问题很多，但到现在全球已经卖出超过4000万份。基努·里维斯在游戏里出演。\n\n2023年推出了资料片《往日之影》，也卖出了1500多万份。动画《边缘行者》也很受欢迎，第二季本月将在网飞上线。", "text": "アメリカのパラマウント・ピクチャーズが、映画を作ると発表しました。トランスフォーマーの映画で有名なプロデューサーと、ゲームを作った会社が一緒に働きます。 ゲームは2020年に出ました。最初は問題が多かったですが、今までに世界で4000万本以上売れました。キアヌ・リーブスが出ています。 2023年には「ファントム・リバティ」という追加のゲームが出ました。", "vocab": [], "title_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation", "summary_original": "The smash hit from the studio behind The Witcher series is to be turned into a film by Paramount Pictures.", "body_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation\nBy\nTom Richardson\nBBC Newsbeat\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nA live-action movie version of smash hit video game Cyberpunk 2077 is being developed by Paramount Pictures.\nThe Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, known for his work on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the developer of the sci-fi role-playing game.\nCDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said in a statement\n,\nexternal\nthe company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".\nDetails of the film's story, potential release date and casting information are yet to be revealed.\nDespite\na troubled launch in 2020\n, the Cyberpunk 2077 video game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide.\nThe John Wick star plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of main character V.\nSet in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players work to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation.\nAn expansion, Phantom Liberty,\nstarring Idris Elba was released in 2023\nand has sold more than 15 million copies, according to CDPR.\nCyberpunk has already been successfully adapted into a popular animated series - Edgerunners - with a second season due to premiere on Netflix later this month.\nThe streamer also produced The Witcher, an adaptation of CDPR's massively popular fantasy role-playing series.\nIt originally starred former Superman actor Henry Cavill, but he was\nreplaced by Liam Hemsworth in the show's fourth season.\nMultiple video game series have been adapted for TV and film in recent years, with more due to follow.\nTwo Super Mario movies, a big screen version of Minecraft and a series of Sonic the Hedgehog films have each seen global box office takings of about $1bn.\nPlayStation game The Last of Us was made into a hit series by HBO, and Prime Video says its adaptation of post-apocalyptic role-playing series Fallout is one of its most-watched programmes.\nXbox maker Microsoft announced this week\n,\nexternal\nit had created a new \"XP\" division to focus on licensing its games for films, theme parks and other tie-ins.\nEarlier this week, Paramount Skydance completed\nits $110bn (£82.8bn) merger\nwith Warner Bros Discovery.\nIt's promised to release 30 films annually for the next two years, but also prompted\nfears over job losses and price rises for streaming services\nsuch as HBO Max and Paramount+.\nAdditional reporting by Peter Gillibrand.\nListen to Newsbeat\nlive\nat 12:45 and 17:45 weekdays - or listen back\nhere\n.\nRelated topics\nGaming", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:47:20.989997", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "アメリカ", "s": 0.163, "e": 0.588, "sm": 162, "em": 587, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "の", "s": 0.6, "e": 0.725, 